hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15849","Yazid narrated to us, he said: Ibn Abi Dhib informed us, from Said ibn Khalid, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Uthman, he said: A physician mentioned a medicine before the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and mentioned a frog to be put in it, so the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, forbade killing the frog."
